{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-matrices","title":"图的矩阵表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations/graph-matrices","wordCount":1633,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-spectra","title":"为何研究图的谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations/why-spectra","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"laplacian-basics","title":"拉普拉斯矩阵基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations/laplacian-basics","wordCount":1436,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>谱图论的全部论证都建立在一个翻译动作上：把图变成矩阵。这一章只做这件翻译工作，以及说清为什么翻译之后值得去看特征值。三篇文档分工明确，互不重叠。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"graph-matrices\">图的矩阵表示</a> 是词典本身。它系统列出邻接矩阵、度矩阵、关联矩阵这几种把图编码成矩阵的方式，讲清有向图与加权图下的变体，以及矩阵幂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 数路径这类基本代数事实。后续所有篇章引用某个矩阵时，定义都回到这里，不再重述。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"why-spectra\">为何研究图的谱</a> 回答动机问题：既然有了矩阵，为什么偏要看它的特征值而不是别的？它讲谱的同构不变性、同谱图（不同的图却有相同的谱）这一深刻现象，以及谱方法相比纯组合方法的独特威力。这一篇不重新构造矩阵，只在 <a href=\"graph-matrices\">图的矩阵表示</a> 的基础上谈&quot;看谱&quot;这件事的意义。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"laplacian-basics\">拉普拉斯矩阵基础</a> 把全 hub 的主角——拉普拉斯矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=D-A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>——单独立起来，证明它的半正定性、零特征值结构、与二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>L</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^\\top L x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Lx</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系，以及归一化拉普拉斯的两种形式。之后「特征值」章的连通性、代数连通度、各类界，全都是在啃这一篇建立的性质。</p>\n<p>在 hub 中的位置：这一章是地基，读完才有资格进入「特征值」章把单个特征值与图性质对应起来。前置只需线性代数的特征值概念和图论的邻接、度、连通分量。</p>\n"}